": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SIqxX29VWL4Q7kNvwEQUYS4&_nc_oc=AdpVaDZ094dB5EX62yYBFeCPxExH_D5NLZavc65sVwsMs_l-jgLel8A_QxX21nu_X3U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQITtfFJwO7uU49Q2OO2qBNzX_8KaZg-q0n4OsA9y7j_DA&oe=6AA691DB"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XPzFdyBtkkwQ7kNvwFIQvs2&_nc_oc=Adpr787FD4E0Sz4RQ88IKg3_0HfZbT51SezQbokmua3EL6hHe0hGp3AkvJulu70EoLM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIBL9aPlbBeTeFuq2uoPk9UJDN95py-LT1-746xHUPmog&oe=6AA6BA61"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gK6lkeVpwH0Q7kNvwGbKovv&_nc_oc=Adqc32bY8GV3FYZE--qg5LT-rgrS-7z5gjZ2f0nRl_1GMxDGNkZep83x1yk-faiN95c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJHGXbOS9F2oQ38zU1dSmHAFLv_blFFmU4DnKkCor-ZJA&oe=6AA6A72F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y1pzZcrWiv0Q7kNvwH6tdFF&_nc_oc=AdqP_Yq8dnZuBckBlHeWc9uySHKtwMW3oLUqWRTRTRnoUr8PL0ib_RwzFJ3nFd0A-JU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLeQrKwHi2YO4_llmLMO-RpO4zvlgsTlaW_5eB_J-D-KQ&oe=6AA6A6D2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CPnC-Jr5Cy4Q7kNvwF5ipHo&_nc_oc=Adrj40NhwP8OV5ZjT-dSiaU9es_kieZEofnFOnj0Wn28sanOTuPkVavSr6biXqALEIc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK4oV9fAMikWUZ-eREPqGhfRgAj-qxooV4xm2kLsGQmvA&oe=6AA6B07D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a